WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.660
My name is Erecpyle Dukakis.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.940
For the great cause of defeating 
the St. Piria Empire,

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.580
I was tasked with preventing

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.650
the political marriage to Jugglaburk.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.740
However, right before we 
captured Princess Ecarlate,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.570
a warrior who calls himself 
DT appeared from the sky.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.640
As a result of two fierce 
battles, I was wounded.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.090
At the place where I went to recuperate

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:21.280
I had my third battle with DT,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.150
who used dirty tricks 
to escape once again.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.550
I am going to bring him 
to justice personally!

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.940
For the future of this world!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.620
You don't have to be on your guard.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.400
It's you.

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:22.410
Only an Ixion could catch 
me off guard like that.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.540
It's been a long time, 
Erecpyle Dukakis.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:32.040
It has, Alma Flora.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.430
It's an emergency!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.060
An enemy attack?

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.980
Or have you discovered the 
whereabouts of DT?

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:57.980
No!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.110
Then what is it?

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.490
Erec-sama is coming back.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.320
What?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.370
Are you serious?

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.550
Would I lie about something like this?

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:08.390
We got an Alma message from the 
headquarters not long ago.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.680
It's confirmed.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.790
He will be joining us at this 
camp in the next few days.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:16.030
Our patience has paid off.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:20.300
I can finally let loose as 
his right-hand man again.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:23.490
Just a moment, KT.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.180
Huh?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.560
What? What's going on?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.370
I can't let that slide.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:32.530
Who decided that you're 
his right-hand man?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.810
What do you mean?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.820
I'm Erec-sama's right-hand man!

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:01.070
I'm so sorry, I lied about my age...

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.870
Nyomi! Nyomi! Don't worry!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.770
I'll save you!

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.640
As the 36th queen of St. Piria, 
I pronounce your sentence,

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:22.100
a crew cut for the rest of your life!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.780
Gah!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.790
Cheers!

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.940
First, let us toast to 
Erec-sama's return.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.840
Well, just make sure that you're not

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:04.450
staggering around drunk 
when he returns, Leon.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:09.580
Unlike some children, 
I know how to limit myself.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.850
It's so sad that

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:15.200
old people must always be 
so envious of the young.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.890
That's the elderly for you.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.940
Experience is valuable, you know.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.460
Let's not even talk about

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.270
how many times I've carried you home

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:24.800
on my back when you were 
too drunk to even see straight.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.280
And just how many girls did

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.320
I have to give up on because of that?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.140
Beating the dead horse is another

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.580
bad habit old people seem to have.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.930
Hey, watch it!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.060
Don't you put me together with Leon.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.320
Gustave, I feel exactly 
the same way about you.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.470
You two should cut it out.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.320
Fighting over something that 
petty won't get you

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.520
the honor of being 
Erec-sama's right-hand man.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.290
Then let me ask you.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:02.870
What do I have to say

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.640
to show you that I am 
Erec-sama's right-hand man?

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.820
Well, I can't really say, but...

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:08.680
I can.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.930
We should each talk 
about our heroic deeds

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.560
to find out who the strongest is.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.070
This sounds interesting.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:27.320
So, who's gonna start?

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.290
What is the most important quality

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.640
in Erec-sama's right-hand man?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:39.080
It is fortitude in the face 
of any pain and any danger.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.230
While you three have been idly

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.340
waiting for our master's return,

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.750
I took a vacation with the goal

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.090
of strengthening 
my fortitude in solitude.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.210
With mind over matter, fire feels cool,

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.950
and a bed of nails 
like a luxurious sofa.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.090
But that's not all.

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:01.030
I pushed my soul and 
body to the very limit

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.510
and kept punishing them.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.870
Um, you did that because 
you're a masochist.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.530
You're nothing but a 
regular old masochist.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.940
I can see it.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.620
Leon being stepped on with 
heels, being whipped,

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.810
being tied up with rough ropes 
and writhing in ecstasy...

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.510
I don't have any interest 
in those things.

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:22.130
You did just spend
 an awfully long time

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.340
telling us about those things.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.930
What good does it do that 
you've confessed to

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.470
being a total masochist?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.290
I am definitely not a masochist,

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.040
but I want you to know this.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.380
Don't think that I only took

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:40.850
my vacation to push 
my body to the limit.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.350
Then what else for?

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:47.730
I learned a new lethal 
move from my training!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:50.930
Something dirty again?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.130
That's not what I mean!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.740
Then what?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.720
I'm talking about moves that kill.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.470
The ladies?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.490
They don't have to be, 
they work on everyone.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.500
You've got a one track mind!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.160
Calm down.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.950
I keep telling you

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:04.370
that what I learned out there

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.150
are honest-to-goodness moves that kill.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.920
The ladies?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:07.970
I'm telling you, they work on everyone.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.510
Shut up, KT.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.110
I learned a very special 
move that could decide

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:17.170
any confrontation and it 
goes by the name of...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.350
Super Golden High Speed 
and High Jump Shrimp

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.640
Big Spinning Doppelganger 
Miracle Attack!

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.040
Hey, Leon.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:26.900
What?

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.650
I dare you to say it again.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.480
Where are we going?

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.790
I believe I know what you want.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.990
Oh yeah?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.790
You know everything.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.300
Here we are.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.680
It's you.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.680
It's one of the Takumi.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.840
Who's this?

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.040
It's fine.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.530
He's with me.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:09.690
But are you done with the 
task I gave to you?

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.920
Of course.

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.070
It was a bit of a hassle.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.070
Follow me.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:23.950
Th-That's...

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.970
My greatest work.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.110
This is the sacred sword Calibre!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:31.770
What?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.610
You can be the best by just 
learning a special move?

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.970
It's child's play, then.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.110
Oh?

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:39.600
What are you saying? 
You've learned a deadly move, too?

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.970
That's exactly right.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.390
Is this another move for the night?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.140
Shut up already.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.570
It's my opinion that the 
most important thing

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.670
for Erec-sama's right-hand 
man is to never give up.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.150
Never giving up
 requires an iron resolve,

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.600
no matter what despairing situation

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.410
one might find oneself in.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:03.550
This happened one night when 
I was on a recon mission.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.000
The circumstances couldn't 
have been worse.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.840
We seemed to invade the enemy's 
territory without a problem,

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.120
but the targets saw through our plans

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.370
and even the most minute maneuvers.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.930
Yes, they knew everything.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:21.610
I had but a select few subordinates,

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:23.960
but since our 
enemy had us surrounded,

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:28.690
one fell, then another, 
until I was finally alone.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.420
It was truly desperate.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:35.320
I didn't even know if I would 
be able to make it out alive.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.320
But I didn't give up.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.890
I used an opening the target 
left and closed the distance.

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:48.500
My enemy was getting 
more and more confused.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.700
The result was

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.550
that I managed a rare feat,

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:56.010
successfully completing 
such a difficult mission.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.010
That's when I mastered 
a deadly move called...

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.750
You're talking about your 
night at the hostess bar.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.090
N-No, I wasn't!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:08.140
Your stutter says it all.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:11.000
So it's literally a move for the night.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.770
Hearing that from you 
is really irritating.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.560
No wonder your wife left you.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.950
Shut up!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.370
This has nothing to do with that.

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:23.260
It has everything to do with it.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.660
That reminds me. She used to say...

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.160
Don't talk about her!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:33.140
Looks like we cleared this up.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.970
I myself am the one most 
qualified to be Erec-sama's...

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.250
Hold on there.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.560
Neither Variation nor I have
 had a chance to speak yet.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.800
I doubt that will do you an—

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.000
I'm not going to be bragging

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.330
about my perverted exploits.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.920
We're supposed to be discussing who is

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.810
the most appropriate 
right-hand man for Erec-sama.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.200
Sheesh.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.230
What do you plan on doing with this

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.830
monstrous thing you made me make?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.440
I'm here to finish it.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:14.750
Listen.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.500
Don't lose it again.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:20.220
Alma Gear is not easy to make.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.340
I swear.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.850
I swear on my life!

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.880
With this... All that ancient hatred...

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:33.230
I can make right the horrible 
wrongs of the past!

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:38.320
Hyperion, I will be watching 
the path you walk.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:42.040
Wait.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.480
I have something else for you.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:02.420
You know, you guys have got 
it fundamentally wrong.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.590
What Erec-sama needs 
in his right-hand man

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:10.180
isn't brute strength, you know?

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.360
Here we go.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.110
KT's talking overly 
feminine shtick when drunk.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:17.560
This never ends well.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.860
And I don't have a clue as to 
what you're babbling about.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.070
You say something?

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.400
No, nothing at all.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.400
Then shut up and listen to me!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.980
The most important quality

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:32.210
in Erec-sama's right-hand man is...

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.410
Like, love.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.210
Like, what?

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:42.310
That morning, I woke up alone in bed.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.940
My room looked as it always had.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.960
When I stretched out my hand,

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.390
I noticed that my bed was empty.

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:55.500
He was gone.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.480
I wondered, had all the passion of

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.980
last night been nothing but an illusion?

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.540
Anxiety and sorrow and something else.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.880
My body became consumed by

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.860
these complex emotions.

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.680
I imagined that he had

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:15.210
set out for the place 
where he now must be.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.390
It's better this way.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:20.800
Yet when I tried to 
tell this to myself,

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.790
I heard a faint sound from 
the back of the room.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.010
And that is when I

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.720
mastered the deadly move 
that they call love.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.860
This is nothing but your fantasy!

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:37.490
Hey!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.990
I'm allowed to fantasize!

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.540
It's disgusting!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.380
You insult Erec-sama with this talk!

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:44.780
Watch yourself!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.180
It's not insulting.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.880
This is a deadly move.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.660
Explain to me what part 
of that is a deadly move?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.270
What's your problem?

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.630
You jelly, bro?

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.470
Excuse me, could we get 
some water over here?!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:59.420
Can you please dump a pail 
of water over this idiot?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:02.270
Ooh, looks like I hit 
the nail on the head!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:05.050
That's it, huh? That's exactly it.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.460
Why you...

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.320
Cool down.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.110
You know you can't really fight KT

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:14.200
once he gets into his maiden mode.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.930
But Erec-sama is engaged.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.530
So what?

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:23.100
Don't you know that the more 
obstacles you place in its path,

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.220
the harder, stronger and more 
passionate love becomes?

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:27.690
Little boy?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.450
I am <i>not</i> a kid!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.410
What did you say?

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.320
I will not let that one slide.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.080
G-Gustave?

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.700
It's idiots like you who make the world

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.030
the crap it is right now.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:43.100
It's people like you

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:45.860
wrecking homes in the entire country!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.090
Because of people like you!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.900
What?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:53.530
You're trying to blame me 
for your wife running away?

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.610
Oh, I didn't know that.

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:58.580
So you're the one that made my wife

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.730
run away from me.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.570
<i>That's the one topic you can't bring up</i>

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.880
<i>with Gustave when he's drunk.</i>

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.980
<i>I've got to step in here</i>

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.740
<i>and steer the conversation 
somewhere else.</i>

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:12.420
So, Leon!

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.370
About that rough rope you 
used in your training...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.740
How can you be sleeping now?!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:23.400
And if that is really true, 
I can't just leave you alone.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.300
You can't leave me alone? 
So you mean...

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:31.380
What? Are you saying that 
you want a piece of me?

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:36.140
Yes, I do, but in a 
totally different sense.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.150
Well, if you're that desperate,

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:42.810
I can let you have a round out of pity.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.650
But then don't come crying to me.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.650
Fine!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.470
Hold it!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:52.030
You two just need to calm down first.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.410
Don't worry. I'm always calm.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.300
That's fine, but you guys are

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.090
forgetting what's important here.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.770
There are things that

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.200
you can't forget even if you want to!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.880
Trying to stop me is useless.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.640
Please understand, Variation.

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:07.950
I'm not talking about that!

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.380
Can you just try to

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:12.210
remember why we're drinking 
here in the first place?

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.590
Because Erec-sama is coming back.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:17.200
And something about his right hand.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.310
That's the ticket.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:19.770
You said it, right there.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:21.620
We got all worked up because we were

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.350
talking about who would 
become his right-hand man.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:26.140
Then everything is as it should be.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.900
Let's all face off, 
right here, right now,

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.270
and the last man standing 
shall be his right-hand man.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:38.250
Things got pretty interesting 
while I was gone.

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:40.170
By gone do you mean asleep?

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.240
Count me in.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.870
I will fight with all my strength!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.440
This is complicated enough, 
so can you just stay out of it?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.040
So, what are the rules?

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.110
You decide.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.250
You'll need at least 
that as a handicap.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.550
Take your handicap and...

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.830
Okay, all right!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.560
Let's do this.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:59.760
We'll find out who the strongest is.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.270
But I will set up the rules.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.150
What is this?

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.710
Can't you tell?

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.050
It's a hunt. A hunt.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.960
What you're saying is that we 
will now engage in a hunt.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.770
That's the idea, but it won't make sense

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:20.910
if we're all buddies for the hunt.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:22.450
I see.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.410
So that's how it'll be.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.570
It doesn't matter who does 
better in the battle.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.210
The one who delivers the finishing blow

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.670
will be Erec-sama's right-hand man.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.890
Does everyone accept that?

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:41.050
Yes.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.610
This is when regular 
training really pays off.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.090
I'm sorry, but I'll decide 
this with a single blow!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.090
Here I go!

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.750
Super Golden High
 Speed... And so on!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.410
Damn...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.480
Looks like you failed, Leon!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.740
Take this! Hostess Club!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:21.900
Here I go!

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.970
Love!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:31.900
No special name.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.620
It's running away!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:38.920
The one who delivers the killing blow

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.400
will be Erec-sama's right-hand man!

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:51.260
Huh?

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.600
What is this?

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.200
It's big.

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.880
More like too big!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.780
This isn't happening.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:13.920
If I die here, I'll never be 
able to face Erec-sama again.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.110
Erec-sama?!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:28.930
I was wondering where you 
four had gone off to.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.370
I wasn't expecting you to 
be facing such large game.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:38.380
Still, I'm pleasantly surprised 
to see that you did not

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.920
neglect your daily training 
while I was gone.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:48.100
You did well. Now I will take over.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.970
I will give this sword a try.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.100
Let's see how this Calibre slices!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.960
Erec-sama!

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.030
We celebrate your homecoming.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.300
We have been waiting 
for you, Erec-sama!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.260
Thank you.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.780
Is anybody hurt?

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:29.370
Nothing we can't handle.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:32.500
Good. Then let's go.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.240
Go where?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:36.350
We have confirmed DT's location.

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:41.260
But first, I must apologize to you all.

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:45.920
Until now, I was obsessed 
with the notion

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:48.240
of defeating him with my own hands.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.870
But I have decided to let this idea go.

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:56.040
Will you lend me your strength?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.450
We've always been ready for that.

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:00.630
Then let's go, Erec-sama!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.410
Erec-sama, what are your orders?

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:14.360
We are off to defeat DT!

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:15.140
Yes, sir!

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:18.150
<i>I'm coming for you, DT.</i>

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.930
Ri—

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:35.390
I'd like a large portion 
of rice, please.

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:11.380
What?

00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:12.940
Kon is homesick?

00:24:12.940 --> 00:24:16.100
Looks like my servant 
is still just a child.

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:19.310
He wants video games and comics 
and cola and hamburgers?

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:21.200
What is he talking about?!

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:24.500
It matters not, make those 
things available to him here!

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:29.900
"Calibre" is another name 
for the sacred sword Excalibur,

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:29.900
and as such, has no 
phallic connotations at all.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:35.020
By the way, Kon's hammer was supposed 
to have the Sanskrit word

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:35.020
for the wish-fulfilling jewel "Cintamani"
 but that was rejected. (LOL)
